From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:34 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] XPCOM: xptcall for 32-bit ARM Windows

The invoke and stub halves of XPCOM's calling glue for the ARM32 Windows ABI
(AAPCS with VFP), which upstream has only for Linux and Android.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
